{"parentUuid":"37821ef4-c789-42be-9a00-19931fd9587a","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a31762a22e4ea769a","attachment":{"type":"queued_command","prompt":"Orchestrator additions (authorised): in bench.html's `vehiclebar` block add `{% include \"_vtabs.html\" %}` after the .bench-status div so the Bench has the same persistent tab strip (spec item 16); the full hero (.vhero from _vbar.html) should render on the Bench too since _vbar renders it for tab == \"bench\": prefer `{% include \"_vbar.html\" %}` at the top of the block if it does not duplicate your status line, otherwise keep yours and add the tabs only. Add a 44px \"Live board\" link (href /v/{vin}/liveboard) next to the Job / Full dossier links. Keep check_bench.py green.","source_uuid":"cf5ba306-08c0-4d78-aa50-804864da2106","origin":{"kind":"coordinator"},"isMeta":true},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c53f7502-9e1e-4d3a-bbaf-b4824908d835","timestamp":"2026-10-08T18:01:59.488Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe coordinator sent a message while you were working:\nOrchestrator additions (authorised): in bench.html's `vehiclebar` block add `{% include \"_vtabs.html\" %}` after the .bench-status div so the Bench has the same persistent tab strip (spec item 16); the full hero (.vhero from _vbar.html) should render on the Bench too since _vbar renders it for tab == \"bench\": prefer `{% include \"_vbar.html\" %}` at the top of the block if it does not duplicate your status line, otherwise keep yours and add the tabs only. Add a 44px \"Live board\" link (href /v/{vin}/liveboard) next to the Job / Full dossier links. Keep check_bench.py green.\n\nAddress this before completing your current task.\n</system-reminder>"}],"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
